## "reach" (`story.ni:7737-7757`) — the source's mistakes.

define action reaching
  grammar
    reach
    reach the target
    reach in the target
    reach into the target
    reach through the target
    reach between the target
    reach for the target
    put hand through the target
    put arm through the target
  the target is a topic
  refuse when the player is in the Jail Cell: unlock-door-hint
  otherwise refuse no-reaching

define phrase no-reaching
  You don't need to 'reach' anything in this game. If you want to see what's
  inside something, just LOOK IN it.
end phrase

define phrase unlock-door-hint
  If you want to try to unlock the door, just type UNLOCK DOOR.
end phrase

