    refuse when the player is in the Jail Cell: peer-out-at-jailhouse
    refuse when Jacobs is in the Jail Cell: peer-in-at-jacobs
    refuse peer-in-at-empty-cell
  end on

  after the player unlocking
    phrase lock-picked-through-the-window
