## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## JACOBS (`story.ni:8021-8452`)
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Jacobs's turns: `lurking` (the shape in the corner), `introduced` (JA2),
## `straining` (at the lock), `sulking` (JA8), `freed` (out of the cell),
## `gone` (JA21, or the drain room). He does not perceive Jack (change
## document, "Who sees her").

define trait kick-jacobs
  on the player kicking
    refuse too-scary-to-mess-with
  end on
end trait

create Jacobs
  aka hulking shape, shape, figure, man, prisoner, huge brute, brute, sneering man, bloodshot eyes, eyes
  a person, proper
  pronouns he
  kick-jacobs
  in the Jail Cell
  states: lurking, introduced, straining, sulking, freed, gone

  Jacobs is a huge brute, with a face that looks young, but already grizzled
  and rough beyond his years. His wide, watery eyes jitter constantly. His
  lip is curled in a constant half-sneer, as though his confinement in jail
  is merely a passing diversion for him. His clothes, though stained and
  rumpled, seem too rich to belong to a common thug.

  when the player's bobby-wakes expires
    phrase bobby-bo16-stub
    start the player's bobby-voice
  end when

  when the player's bobby-voice expires
    start the player's guards-return
    phrase jacobs-ja2-stub
    change Jacobs to introduced when Jacobs is lurking
  end when

  when lockpicking expires
    phrase jacobs-ja8-stub
    move the piece of wire offstage
    change the straw to hiding
    change Jacobs to sulking
  end when

  when leaving expires
    Jacobs goes north
    change Jacobs to freed
  end when

  when offering expires, while Jacobs is here
    phrase jacobs-ja19-stub
    start Olmer's pleading
    start withdrawing
  end when

  when withdrawing expires, while Jacobs is here
    phrase jacobs-ja21-stub
    move Jacobs offstage
    change Jacobs to gone
  end when

  when the player's guards-return expires, while the player is in the Prison
    kill the player guards-return-stub
  end when

  on the player talking
    refuse when Jacobs is straining: jacobs-ignores-you
    phrase jacobs-ja20-stub when Jacobs is freed
    phrase jacobs-ja21-stub when Jacobs is freed
    move Jacobs offstage when Jacobs is freed
