## `story.ni:8538`, verbatim.

define phrase jacobs-mutters-and-goes
  You can hear Jacobs muttering angrily in the room behind you, then heavy
  footsteps that quickly fade away.
end phrase

## `story.ni:8543`, verbatim, both halves.

define phrase olmer-explains-the-alcove
  'The guards use this place to relieve themselves,' Olmer explains, 'and
  sometimes for beatin' prisoners when they don't feel like moppin' the
  cells after. My back's not much for physical labor, but a spry one like
  yourself should have little trouble.' He motions for you to lift up the
  grate.
end phrase

define phrase olmer-explains-the-alcove-moved
  'The guards use this place to relieve themselves,' Olmer explains, 'and
  sometimes for beatin' prisoners when they don't feel like moppin' the
  cells after. I see you've already made some progress,' Olmer adds, noting
  the moved grate. 'All's left is to reap the fruits of your generous
  labor.'

  He smiles and gestures towards the foul-smelling hole. 'After you,' he
  wheezes.
end phrase

## The grate (`story.ni:8497-8517`): lift it, and every other verb lifts it.

## `raising` is a full-delegation capability action (ADR-118) that never
## consults entity clauses, so the lift is a story action.

define action lifting
  grammar
    lift the target
    raise the target
    lift up the target
    pull up the target
  otherwise refuse cant-lift-that

## GLUE — the platform's own shape for a thing that will not lift.

define phrase cant-lift-that
  You can't lift that.
end phrase

define trait grate-lift
  on the player lifting
    refuse when the metal grate is moved: grate-too-heavy
    change the metal grate to moved
    phrase grate-lifted when Olmer is not here
    phrase grate-lifted-after-you when Olmer is here
  end on

  on the player opening
    refuse when the metal grate is moved: grate-too-heavy
    change the metal grate to moved
    phrase grate-lifted when Olmer is not here
    phrase grate-lifted-after-you when Olmer is here
  end on

  on the player pushing
    refuse when the metal grate is moved: grate-too-heavy
    change the metal grate to moved
    phrase grate-lifted when Olmer is not here
    phrase grate-lifted-after-you when Olmer is here
  end on

  on the player pulling
    refuse when the metal grate is moved: grate-too-heavy
    change the metal grate to moved
    phrase grate-lifted when Olmer is not here
    phrase grate-lifted-after-you when Olmer is here
  end on

  on the player taking
    refuse when the metal grate is moved: grate-too-heavy
    change the metal grate to moved
    phrase grate-lifted when Olmer is not here
    phrase grate-lifted-after-you when Olmer is here
  end on
end trait

create the metal grate
  aka grate, bars, thick bars, metal bars, cover, heavy grate
  scenery
  grate-lift
  in the Drain Room
  states: seated, moved

  {grate-description-set}{grate-description-moved}

  on the player examining
    phrase grate-description-set when the metal grate is seated
    phrase grate-description-moved when the metal grate is moved
  end on

  on the player entering
    refuse when the metal grate is seated: cant-squeeze-the-bars
    move the player to the Sewer
  end on

  on the player searching
    refuse hole-too-dark
  end on

  on the player listening
    refuse running-water-below
  end on

