define phrase hole-too-dark
  The hole is too dark and too deep for you to see the bottom, although you
  think you can hear the sound of running water coming from far below.
end phrase

define phrase running-water-below
  You can faintly hear the sound of running water coming from below.
end phrase

define phrase cant-squeeze-the-bars
  You can't squeeze between the bars of the grate.
end phrase

