## one of four rotations, redrawn after a correct move. See the header.

create the magic color
  aka magic colour
  states, reversible: red, blue, green, yellow

  The colour Olmer named.

create the glyph layout
  states, reversible: layout-a, layout-b, layout-c, layout-d

  The glyphs, as they stand.

define condition north-marked: (the glyph layout is layout-a and the magic color is red) or (the glyph layout is layout-b and the magic color is yellow) or (the glyph layout is layout-c and the magic color is green) or (the glyph layout is layout-d and the magic color is blue)
define condition east-marked: (the glyph layout is layout-a and the magic color is blue) or (the glyph layout is layout-b and the magic color is red) or (the glyph layout is layout-c and the magic color is yellow) or (the glyph layout is layout-d and the magic color is green)
define condition south-marked: (the glyph layout is layout-a and the magic color is green) or (the glyph layout is layout-b and the magic color is blue) or (the glyph layout is layout-c and the magic color is red) or (the glyph layout is layout-d and the magic color is yellow)
define condition west-marked: (the glyph layout is layout-a and the magic color is yellow) or (the glyph layout is layout-b and the magic color is green) or (the glyph layout is layout-c and the magic color is blue) or (the glyph layout is layout-d and the magic color is red)

