define phrase olmer-takes-his-leave-red
  'Darrens and I, we must be off elsewhere, so we'll take our leave of you
  now. But follow the red and you can't go wrong.'
end phrase

define phrase olmer-takes-his-leave-blue
  'Darrens and I, we must be off elsewhere, so we'll take our leave of you
  now. But follow the blue and you can't go wrong.'
end phrase

