  The vents are high out of reach.
end phrase

## The painted symbols (`story.ni:8621-8640`): the report reads the layout.
## Symbols ride the colours (see the header).

define condition in-the-glyph-tunnels: the player is in the Sewer or the player is in the North Tunnel or the player is in the East Tunnel or the player is in the South Tunnel or the player is in the West Tunnel or the player is in the North Bend or the player is in the East Bend or the player is in the South Bend or the player is in the West Bend

create the painted symbols
  aka symbols, symbol, glyph, glyphs, odd symbols, shapes, paint, red glyph, blue glyph, green glyph, yellow glyph, red square, blue diamond, green circle, yellow triangle, square, diamond, circle, triangle
  scenery, plural
  in the Sewer

  The symbols are a number of crude shapes, no bigger than your hand. Each
  one is painted on the wall next to one of the side tunnels, as if to mark
  the way.

  phrase present:
    Painted on the walls are a number of odd symbols.

  when Jack moves, while in-the-glyph-tunnels
    move the painted symbols here
  end when

  on the player examining
    first time
      phrase symbols-crude-shapes
    phrase glyph-north-red when the glyph layout is layout-a
    phrase glyph-east-blue when the glyph layout is layout-a
    phrase glyph-south-green when the glyph layout is layout-a
    phrase glyph-west-yellow when the glyph layout is layout-a
    phrase glyph-north-yellow when the glyph layout is layout-b
    phrase glyph-east-red when the glyph layout is layout-b
    phrase glyph-south-blue when the glyph layout is layout-b
    phrase glyph-west-green when the glyph layout is layout-b
    phrase glyph-north-green when the glyph layout is layout-c
    phrase glyph-east-yellow when the glyph layout is layout-c
    phrase glyph-south-red when the glyph layout is layout-c
    phrase glyph-west-blue when the glyph layout is layout-c
    phrase glyph-north-blue when the glyph layout is layout-d
    phrase glyph-east-green when the glyph layout is layout-d
    phrase glyph-south-yellow when the glyph layout is layout-d
    phrase glyph-west-red when the glyph layout is layout-d
  end on

