create the Access Tunnel
  a room
  aka tunnel, sewer, sewers
  up to the Empty Alleyway, one-way
  north is deadly: lost-in-the-sewers
  east is deadly: lost-in-the-sewers
  south is deadly: lost-in-the-sewers
  west is deadly: lost-in-the-sewers

