define phrase cant-reach-the-hatch
  You can't reach the hatch from down here.
end phrase

create the ladder
  aka rungs, bolted ladder
  scenery, climbable
  in the Access Tunnel

  The ladder leads up to a hatch in the ceiling above you.

  phrase present:
