  on the player climbing
    move the player to the Empty Alleyway
  end on

## The way up: the source moves her straight to Commerce Street after the
## daylight text; the alley the text describes is a room here so the text
## comes first. Chapter VI begins on it; the hour turns to day.

create the Empty Alleyway
  a room
  aka alleyway, alley

  first time
    You eagerly pull yourself up the rungs and shove open the hatch.
    Daylight! You've never been so glad to see it.

    From the look of the sky, it's early morning. You're standing in an
    empty alleyway, pretty close to Maiden House if you have your landmarks
    right. After a couple of turns, you figure out where you are, and soon
    find yourself back in familiar environs.

  An empty alleyway, pretty close to Maiden House.

  after the player entering
    change the hatch to opened
    change Toresal to day
    move the orphans offstage
    move the player to the Commerce Street
  end after
